#: announcements/plasma-5.2.2.php:44
msgid ""
"Plasma Desktop: Extract UI messages. <a href='http://quickgit.kde.org/?"
"p=plasma-desktop."
"git&a=commit&h=12f750d497c5f2def14d89ad669057e13197b6f8'>Commit."
